---@field attestation? gcp.unstable.binaryauthorization_v1beta1.AttestationOccurrence Required. An AttestationOccurrence to be checked that it can be verified by the `Attestor`. It does not have to be an existing entity in Container Analysis. It must otherwise be a valid `AttestationOccurrence`.
---@field occurrenceResourceUri? string Required. The URI of the artifact (e.g. container image) that is the subject of the containing Occurrence.
---@field attestor string Required. The resource name of the Attestor of the occurrence, in the format `projects/*/attestors/*`.

